        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "还 + additional or stronger predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "还 can add a stronger or further point to an existing scale. The relation is additive or escalating, rather than continuation in time.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他比我还忙。",
                "pinyin": "tā bǐ wǒ hái máng 。",
                "meaning": "He is even busier than I am.",
                "audio": "07fdad197ae03d89ec76c5318092ae71aa0bcd71aa93bdfbfaa331275fdebb35"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书比那本还贵。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū bǐ nà běn hái guì 。",
                "meaning": "This book is more expensive still.",
